CardDescriptionm = "\"**Prodigy** *(This card can be played into an empty Party Slot as if it were a lvl 1 Adventurer.)*When you play Sebastion from your hand onto one of your empty Party Slots, look at the top 4 cards of your deck. You may reveal any number of Adventurers you find there and put them into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck. Sebastion gains 1 Buff Counter for each card put into your hand this way.\""
